      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.973,
      "back_translation": "在一些国家，比如德国或日本，守时非常重要。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.875,
      "back_translation": "人们认为开会或约会迟到是不礼貌的。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.6809,
      "back_translation": "他们喜欢把日程写得很清楚，什么时间做什么都安排好。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7429,
      "back_translation": "如果事情没有准时开始，有些人会不高兴。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9811,
      "back_translation": "但是在另一些国家，比如西班牙或巴西，人们对时间的看法更轻松。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7692,
      "back_translation": "朋友聚会可能说是“晚上七点”，但实际上可能八点甚至更晚才开始。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "verdict": "rewritten",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": true,
      "notes": "\"Everyone does not think\" was ambiguous (could read as not everyone); gold means nobody sees it as a problem.",
      "tightness": 0.9375,
      "back_translation": "大家不觉得这是问题，因为他们更看重人与人之间的交流，而不是严格遵守时间。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "这种文化差异在全球化时代变得特别重要。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8235,
      "back_translation": "现在很多人要和来自不同国家的人合作。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8529,
      "back_translation": "比如，中国公司和墨西哥公司合作一个项目时，双方对会议时间的理解可能不同。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9259,
      "back_translation": "中国人可能习惯准时开始，而墨西哥人可能觉得稍微迟到没关系。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9524,
      "back_translation": "如果双方不理解对方的时间观念，就容易产生误会。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8649,
      "back_translation": "所以，在国际交往中，理解别人的文化非常重要。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8077,
      "back_translation": "不要马上评价别人“懒惰”或“不专业”，也许他们只是生活方式不同。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 16,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.6818,
      "back_translation": "提前沟通日程，理解彼此的习惯，才能让合作更好。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 17,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8571,
      "back_translation": "虽然守时很重要，但理解和尊重文化差异同样重要。"
